@startuml cgc_course_content_learning_privacy

title CGC Course Content, Learning and Workflow Privacy
left to right direction
hide methods
hide stereotypes
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam entity { BackgroundColor #F8FAFC; BorderColor #475569 }

entity User
entity Workspace
entity Membership
entity Course
entity CurriculumDraft
entity CourseRevision
entity Chapter
entity Issue
entity Objective
entity Material
entity Enrollment
entity LearningRun
entity WorkflowRun
entity LearnerProgressProjection
entity TutorTeachingProjection
entity PlatformAuditProjection

User ||--o{ Membership
Workspace ||--o{ Membership
Workspace ||--o{ Course
Course ||--o| CurriculumDraft
Course ||--o{ CourseRevision
CourseRevision ||--o{ Chapter
Chapter ||--o{ Issue
Issue ||--o{ Objective
Objective }o--o{ Material
User ||--o{ Enrollment
Course ||--o{ Enrollment
Enrollment ||--o{ LearningRun
CourseRevision ||--o{ LearningRun : bound revision

WorkflowRun ..> CurriculumDraft : produces
LearningRun ..> LearnerProgressProjection : self only
LearningRun ..> TutorTeachingProjection : assigned course
WorkflowRun ..> PlatformAuditProjection : redacted metadata only

note right of WorkflowRun
Raw execution record.
Never a Workspace feed.
end note

note right of CourseRevision
Published immutable snapshot.
Web reader source of truth.
end note

note right of Material
text / markdown / web / image / video
Video first adapter: Bilibili.
No arbitrary iframe HTML.
end note

@enduml
